UID:6a88a067bd682a53a241b9ad@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:OCA is proud to present “Poets Meet Artists”\, a collabora
 tion where artists and poets work together to create a mutual celebration 
 of both media. Poets honor visual artists by writing a poem to interpret t
 heir art\, and artists created a piece of art to interpret a poem. Join us
  as we celebrate this special connection between poetry and art at our rec
 eption on Saturday\, October 3rd where you’ll enjoy selected readings by
  the poets and the exhibit of paired works.\nPoets and Artists included in
  this exhibit:\nSuze Cohan\nMarilu Downing\nAndrea van Dyke\nSarah Dupre\n
 Patrick Fanning\nSteve Fowler\nElizabeth Herron\nRich Levin\nDiane masura\
 nJessica Morell\nSu Mcmurtry\nLeslie Pickford\nElise Loveday Brown\nDarcy 
