BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Laurie Lewis and the Right Hands
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T173000
UID:6a907e9d1fab5577542c53a7@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:Bluegrass and American Roots Music\nDon't miss this incredible
  show at OCA! Bluegrass legend Laurie Lewis and her amazing band The RIght
  Hands will give us an afternoon show that you won't soon forget. Laurie w
 ill be joined by Brandon Godman\, Hasee Ciaccio and other fine musicians f
 or this performance.\nTickets are $35\, $30 for OCA members. Doors open at
  2:30 PM. Refreshments available\, free parking. Art gallery open during i
 ntermission. ADA seating available - please contact us at\ninfo@occidental
 centerforthearts.org\nfor details.\nGet Tickets\nFor nearly four decades\,
  Laurie Lewis has gathered fans and honors for her powerful and emotive vo
 ice and her versatile\, dynamic songwriting. She is a sought-after recordi
 ng producer and an equally skilled teacher and mentor.\nAnd she is an insp
 iration and a ground-breaker – across genres\, across geography and acro
 ss gender barriers.\nLaurie has shown us how a woman can blend into any pa
 rt of the classic bluegrass singing trio\, and she showed us how a great v
 oice could move fluidly between bluegrass and other types of music. She sh
 owed us how a female fiddler could emulate the strength and grit of the ea
 rly bluegrass musicians. She has shown how a Californian can appeal to tra
 ditional bluegrass audiences\, as well as winning acclaim in the worlds of
  Americana and folk music.\nShe has shown us how to lead bands of talented
  musicians – learning from them while helping them make their best music
 . And she has shown us how to thrive in a constantly changing musical envi
 ronment – without ever sacrificing her art.\n"Her voice is a rare combin
 ation of grit and grace\, strength and delicacy. Her stories always ring t
 rue."\nLinda Ronstadt
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/laurie-lewi
 s-and-the-right-hands
X-SOURCE:Occidental Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
